&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking a talented individual to join our DMFI (Discretionary Macro and Fixed Income) business in the New York office. You will join a small, high-impact team within DMFI Strategies focused on data-driven analysis across fixed income and macro markets. The team combines deep market intuition with rigorous quantitative methods to identify relative value opportunities in rates and broader fixed income. You will work directly alongside the Portfolio Manager and gain significant exposure to live trading, macro analysis, and the end-to-end investment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
