&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Quantitative C++ Developer Intern to join our team and contribute to the high-performance systems that power our trading strategies, market data processing and research infrastructure. The role will suit someone with strong competitive programming instincts, solid C++ fundamentals, and genuine curiosity about applying agentic AI tools to real-world quantitative workflows. The internship will be 3-6 months, including the summer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[7304],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
