&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;The individual will work very closely with other middle office team members to assist with day-to-day operational duties across the OTC product suite, including IRS, CDS, Bond TRS, Equity TRS, Div Swaps, OTC Options, and Vol &amp;amp; Var Swaps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some of the key responsibilities are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process trade bookings and lifecycle events for OTC products (IRS, CDS, FX, FX Options, Bond TRS, Equity TRS, Div Swaps, OTC Options and Vol &amp;amp; Var Swaps)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trade affirmations and paper confirmations for OTC derivatives, with daily liaison with executing brokers and counterparties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Static data management for OTC products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure trade flow is accurately processed across all systems, including lifecycle events such as resets, fixings and terminations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Affirm cash settlement amounts and process cash wires for OTC products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with trading desk, PMs and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;T0 trade matching using MTM, Markitwire and PB portals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;T0 recs and ad-hoc requests across OTC asset classes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data accuracy to trading desk and PMs, through various reporting tools (P&amp;amp;L, NAVs, positions etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support with swap resets, dividend accruals, and margin/collateral queries&lt;/li&gt;
