&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role with many hats; this candidate will be responsible for extensive scheduling and calendar management, preparing agendas for meetings, expenses. They will arrange domestic and international travel, accommodations, itineraries, and all correspondence related to arrangements including flights, hotels, car service, meetings, restaurant reservations and generating concise reports and dashboards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;They will support with Business Development related activities; archiving, organizing, and updating all internal notes, communications, and candidate materials within the CRM database. This candidate will be responsible for working with the heads of BD and Risk to prepare materials for biweekly meetings. This candidate will serve as the operational hub for DMFI Business Development, the hiring pipeline progresses smoothly; they will also log and organize all incoming resumes/CVs, maintain real-time status updates, capture interview notes, prepare meeting materials, managing relationships with search firms and other external vendors to deliver a first-class candidate experience and proactively flag bottlenecks or next steps for key stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;What you need:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written &amp;amp; verbal communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Outlook and Microsoft Office Suite (Word, Excel, Powerpoint)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize and manage multiple streams of information &amp;amp; tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process-oriented and very strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Efficient time management and strong sense of urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational and time-management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-Starter - Strong ownership of processes and end products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personable, mature, and poised&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal Traits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambitious&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture carrier&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
