&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the QR Library Architecture team you will be in charge of designing and implementing key parts of our cross-asset analytics framework. More specifically, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;implement credit pricing and risk models (corp bonds, loans, securitized products) within our shared cross-asset framework&lt;/li&gt;
